  "sp.sys.legend_html": "<b>The sun</b> is what most of the group likes. <b>The closer the orbit</b>, the more of a person’s Yes/Love match the majority. A planet with a ring is a Top, a pink one with a moon is a Bottom, a grey one has no role set. Similar people stand side by side, Top + Bottom pairs first. The number above the sun is how many practices more than half of the group like ({n}).",
