  "help.leg_html": "<p><b>🛡 Legion</b>: the 18 Space Marine legions, loyal and traitor together, each with its own constellation. Your favourite themes decide, as for the factions. If your three best legions are almost equal, nobody can tell who you are, so you belong to the Alpha Legion. And if a loyal and a traitor legion match almost exactly, your records have been erased: legion II or XI.</p><p>A fan mode, not connected with Games Workshop: names only, the signs are drawn anew.</p>",
