  "help.av_html": "<p><b>🌀 Avatar</b> — your bending element after Avatar: The Last Airbender and The Legend of Korra: Water, Earth, Fire or Air. It comes from your groups and favourite themes (clusters): Water — tenderness and fluids, Earth — bondage and order, Fire — S/M and drive, Air — role-play and exhibitionism.</p><p>Under the element is its type, if you have one: <b>common</b> (Plantbending for Water, Sandbending for Earth), <b>special</b> (Healing, Metalbending, Lightning) or <b>rare</b> (Bloodbending, Lavabending, Combustionbending). Air has no types. Very rarely, any element gets <b>Energybending</b>.</p><p><b>The Avatar</b> — only with Yes or Love on 90 % or more of all practices: then all four elements and your native one.</p><p>A fan mode, not connected with Nickelodeon or Paramount: names only, the symbols are drawn anew.</p>",
  "help.compareAv_html": "<p><b>🌀 Avatar</b> in a comparison — for two, “The pair's elements”: the same element, or at least shared main groups. For a group, “Team Avatar”: everyone's element and type.</p>",
