  "help.rz_html": "<p><b>📖 Re:Zero Sins</b> — one of the seven deadly sins of Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World: Pride, Greed, Envy, Wrath, Sloth, Lust or Gluttony — and your rank in it: <b>Follower</b>, <b>Sin Archbishop</b> or, rarest of all, <b>Witch</b>. The further your sin is ahead of the others, the higher the rank.</p><p>Lust, Gluttony, Wrath and Pride come from your sections and favourite themes. Greed is how often you answer “Yes” and “Love”, Envy how often you answer “Maybe”. And Sloth goes to those who were too lazy to finish the list: the more items left unanswered, the higher the rank. If the list was filled from a template, only the template's items count.</p><p>A fan mode, not connected with the authors or publishers of Re:Zero: names only, the signs are drawn anew.</p>",
